## Recommended Architecture

### Secure Secrets Management Flow

```
┌─────────────┐     ┌──────────────────┐     ┌─────────────────┐
│ Application │────▶│ Secrets Manager  │────▶│ Cloud Provider  │
│   (app.js)  │◄────│   (Cache/Proxy)  │◄────│   (Vault/SM)    │
└─────────────┘     └──────────────────┘     └─────────────────┘
